From 9de7bb6c63c79082e9721d2433e57099363b1ad3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Richard W.M. Jones" <rjones@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 09:12:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add -it nfc mode

This uses nbdkit-nfc-plugin (a free golang reimplementation) to access
the NFC protocol over port 902.

(cherry picked from commit ec603153c06c35fc5393239d2cc6c791555b8663)
